statement.p:
Find the matrix A of the linear transformation
T(M)=  \left[\begin{array}{cc}
9 \amp 7\cr
0 \amp 2
\end{array}\right] M {\left[\begin{array}{cc}
9 \amp 7\cr
0 \amp 2
\end{array}\right]}^{-1}
from U^{2\times 2} to U^{2\times 2} (upper triangular matrices) with respect to the standard basis for U^{2\times 2} given by
\left\lbrace \left[\begin{array}{cc}
1 \amp 0\cr
0 \amp 0
\end{array}\right], \left[\begin{array}{cc}
0 \amp 1\cr
0 \amp 0
\end{array}\right], \left[\begin{array}{cc}
0 \amp 0\cr
0 \amp 1
\end{array}\right] \right\rbrace.
